{
  "id": "2SA.7",
  "number": "7",
  "bookId": "2SA",
  "reference": "2 Samwiri 7",
  "verseCount": 29,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "7",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2SA 7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "7",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mikwenda pa Nathan ri Daudi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kere Daudi oripo peco pere, aka Rwoth ogwoko go kwoŋ jokwor pere je. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo to kere waco ri Nathan jatuci wac Were ni, “Neni pama, an abedo i ot m'ogeti gi mbawo matek ma yath sida, to Kakan ma Cikirok pa Were bedo i wema.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nathan odwoko go ni, “Tim gima nitie i paro perin je; kole Rwoth nitie kodin.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To wor no won Rwoth to waco ri Nathan ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kadhi iwaci ri ŋeca paran Daudi ni, ‘Rwoth waco nike iŋat'ikila geto ran ot ma bed'iye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wok i hongo m'aboth'iye ji paran Joisiraili wok i piny Misir tundo gunyo ni, fodi akibedo i ot; to oyido awotho gi jo munyo abedo i wema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kabedo moro je m'atieko woth'iye gi ji paran Joisiraili, fodi akiluwo gi jotel pajo m'ayero dhumo jo t'awaco nike raŋo jo kigeti ran ot ma mbawo matek ma yath sida.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Riameno wac ri ŋeca paran Daudi nike An, Rwoth pa lwak jolweny, waco rigo ni, ‘Akwanyin i kwath rombo i sa t'alokin jadhum pa ji paran Isiraili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atieko bedo kodin kamoro je m'itieko kadh'iye, aka atieko kikengila jokwor perin je ruwaŋin. Abino miyo nyingin bedo madwoŋ paka jodhum madongo i piny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka abino yero kabedo ri ji paran Isiraili, aka alapidho tiendi jo kenyo kapa jo wegi m'ongoye ŋata bino cando jo kendo; aka cwo ma jomaker jokibino miyo jo litho paka cango; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wok cuka ayero jotel ri ji paran Isiraili. Jokwor perin kendo jokilacandin. Aciko gwokin kwoŋ jokwor perin je aka alamiyin nyikwayin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.89.4+PSA.89.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 89:4-5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.132.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "132:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.7.42"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoh 7:42",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.2.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tim 2:30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "K'inotho, t'iyikin gi kwarere mewin in, abino loko wodin acel kere aka abino loko ker pere matek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go ama bino geto ran ot, aka alaneno nike dhum pere medere cil gi cil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.89.27+PSA.89.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 89:27-28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CO.6.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kor 6:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.1.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ebu 1:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alabedo bamere, aka go bino bedo wodan. Ka go otim reco, abino miyo go gir'acula paka ba nyathi miyo wode gir'acula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "T'akibino kwanyo woko mar paran kwoŋ go paka atimo ri Saulo; m'akwanyo woko bedo kere to akethin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.89.37+PSA.89.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 89:37-38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka noknok ibino bedo gi nyikwayin, aka abino miyo ker perin kiyindira cil gi cil. Dhum perin kilabedo gi gike.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nathan owaco ri Daudi kisi gima Were owaco rigo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kwayo pa Daudi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Daudi okadho to donjo i wema ruwaŋ Rwoth, obedo piny aka okwayo ama, “Abedo ŋa, Rwoth Were, aka peco paran a ginaŋo ma ikelan tundo ka? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka kiri me oyido obedo gimathin i waŋin Rwoth Were; iluwo kwoŋ nyikwayan i hongo ma bino yuwiye, aka inyuthan luse ma yuwiye Rwoth Were. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka onyo Daudi owaci rin aŋo kendo; rupiri iŋeyan, awi Rwoth Were! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole obedo mito perin kodi atoŋa perin timo gime; itimo gigipiny madongo me je ma fonjan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Riameno idwoŋ Rwoth Were; rupiri ongoye ŋata pimere kodin, aka ongoye Were man ma cale in, ro gima watieko winjo je gi ithi wan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ongoye nono man i piny ma cale gi Isiraili, m'ibotho wok i twec bedo ji perin. Gigipiny madongo kodi gir'aura m'itimo rijo omiyo nyingin dwoŋ i piny gibe. Ibotho ji perin wok i Misir aka iriemo woko nonin man munyo ji perin jowotho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Itieko loko Isiraili ji perin cil gi cil, aka in Rwoth, ibedo Were pajo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aka onyo pama Rwoth Were, ridhi cil gi cil wac m'iluwo kwoŋ ŋeca perin kodi nyikwaye aka tim gim'iwaco. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ji jobino tiŋo nyingin malo cil gi cil ka jowaco ni, ‘Rwoth pa lwak jolweny obedo Were i Isiraili.’ Aka ibino kuro dhum paran i hongo je. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole in, Rwoth pa lwak jolweny, Were pa Isiraili inyuthan, ŋeca perin gime aka itieko waco ran nike ibino loko nyikwayan kerin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka onyo pama Rwoth Were, in ibedo Were; aka noknok ikuro cikirok perin, aka itieko timo cikirok ma gir'aura me ran. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onyo riameno akwayin imiy nyikwayan silwany, ŋey jowomedere siemirok i wor perin. Kole in, Rwoth Were itieko ciko gime, aka gi silwany perin nyikwayan jobino bedo josilwany cil gi cil.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
